  "spec": "Deterministic integer RNG shared with the C++ generator (documented in archetypes.json).\n\n    next_u64: state += 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15; z = state; z = (z ^ (z >> 30)) * 0xBF58476D1CE4E5B9;\n              z = (z ^ (z >> 27)) * 0x94D049BB133111EB; return z ^ (z >> 31)   (all mod 2^64)\n    uniform(): (next_u64 >> 11) * 2^-53  in [0,1)",
  "salted_seed": "state = seed XOR archetype_salt (see Scripts/prepare_content.py)",
  "golden_references": "Content/Data/Scenes/generated.*.json are this generator's outputs for the listed seeds"
 },
